## Flujo de Protocolos Detallado

### 1. Comunicación Sincrónica (HTTP/REST)

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as 👤 Cliente
    participant App as 📱 Aplicación
    participant Gateway as 🌐 API Gateway
    participant LB as ⚖️ Load Balancer
    participant LP1 as 🏦 Servicio LP1
    participant LP2 as 🏛️ Servicio LP2
    participant Cache as ⚡ Redis

    Note over Client,Cache: HTTP/REST Synchronous Communication

    %% Request Flow
    Client->>App: 1. POST /validacion
    App->>Gateway: 2. HTTP POST /api/v1/banco/validacion
    
    %% Check cache
    Gateway->>Cache: 3. GET /validacion/session_{id}
    Cache-->>Gateway: 4. Cache miss
    
    %% Load balancing
    Gateway->>LB: 5. Forward request
    LB->>LP1: 6. Route to healthy instance
    
    %% Service processing
    LP1->>LP2: 7. HTTP GET /api/v1/reniec/consulta/12345678
    
    %% Response flow
    LP2-->>LP1: 8. HTTP 200 OK {ciudadano}
    LP1->>Cache: 9. SET /validacion/session_{id}
    Cache-->>LP1: 10. OK
    
    LP1-->>LB: 11. HTTP 200 OK
    LB-->>Gateway: 12. Response
    Gateway-->>App: 13. HTTP 200 OK
    App-->>Client: 14. Validación exitosa
```

