### 2. Comunicación Asíncrona (AMQP/RabbitMQ)

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant LP1 as 🏦 Servicio LP1
    participant Ex as 📬 Exchange
    participant Q as 📋 Queue
    participant LP2 as 🏛️ Servicio LP2
    participant DB as 🗄️ Database
    participant RMQ as 🐰 RabbitMQ

    Note over LP1,RMQ: AMQP Asynchronous Communication

    %% Publishing
    LP1->>Ex: 1. Publish message
    Note right of Ex: Exchange: validacion_exchange<br/>Routing Key: validacion.reniec<br/>Persistence: yes
    Ex->>Q: 2. Route message
    
    %% Queuing
    Q->>Q: 3. Persistent storage
    Q->>Q: 4. Acknowledgment
    
    %% Consumption
    LP2->>Q: 5. Consume message
    Q->>LP2: 6. Deliver message
    
    %% Processing
    LP2->>DB: 7. Query database
    DB-->>LP2: 8. Return data
    
    LP2->>Q: 9. Acknowledge processing
    Note right of Q: Message acknowledged<br/>Removed from queue
```

