### 3. Comunicación de Base de Datos (TCP/SQL)

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant App as 💻 Aplicación
    participant Pool as 🏊 Connection Pool
    participant DB as 🗄️ PostgreSQL
    participant Cache as ⚡ Redis

    Note over App,Cache: TCP/Database Communication

    %% Connection Management
    App->>Pool: 1. Request connection
    Pool->>Pool: 2. Check available connections
    Pool->>DB: 3. Establish TCP connection
    DB-->>Pool: 4. Connection OK
    Pool-->>App: 5. Return connection
    
    %% Query Execution
    App->>DB: 6. SELECT * FROM clientes WHERE dni = ?
    DB->>DB: 7. Parse and optimize query
    DB->>DB: 8. Execute query plan
    DB-->>App: 9. Return result set
    
    %% Connection Release
    App->>Pool: 10. Release connection
    Pool->>Pool: 11. Reset connection state
    Pool->>DB: 12. Keep connection alive
    
    %% Optional Cache
    App->>Cache: 13. SETNX result_{hash}
    Cache-->>App: 14. Cache stored
```

