## Protocolos de Seguridad

### 1. Autenticación y Autorización

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as 👤 Cliente
    participant Auth as 🛡️ Auth Service
    participant JWT as 🎫 JWT Service
    participant Gateway as 🌐 API Gateway
    participant LP1 as 🏦 Servicio LP1
    participant RBAC as 👥 RBAC Service

    Note over Client,RBAC: Authentication & Authorization Flow

    %% Step 1: Login
    Client->>Auth: 1. POST /login {credentials}
    Auth->>Auth: 2. Validate credentials
    Auth->>JWT: 3. Request token creation
    JWT-->>Auth: 4. JWT token created
    Auth-->>Client: 5. Return JWT + refresh token
    
    %% Step 2: API Access
    Client->>Gateway: 6. POST /api/v1/validacion {JWT}
    
    %% Step 3: Token Validation
    Gateway->>JWT: 7. Validate JWT signature
    JWT-->>Gateway: 8. Token valid
    
    %% Step 4: Authorization Check
    Gateway->>RBAC: 9. Check permissions
    RBAC-->>Gateway: 10. Permission granted
    
    %% Step 5: Service Access
    Gateway->>LP1: 11. Forward request
    LP1-->>Gateway: 12. Service response
    Gateway-->>Client: 13. API response
    
    %% Step 6: Token Refresh
    Note over Client, JWT: 14. Refresh token before expiration
    Client->>JWT: 14. POST /refresh {refresh_token}
    JWT-->>Client: 15. New JWT tokens
```

