## Rate Limiting y Throttling

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as 👤 Cliente
    participant RL as 🎯 Rate Limiter
    participant Redis as ⚡ Redis
    participant Gateway as 🌐 API Gateway
    participant LP1 as 🏦 Servicio LP1

    Note over Client,LP1: Rate Limiting Flow

    %% Rate Limit Check
    Client->>RL: 1. POST /api/v1/validacion
    
    %% Check rate limit in Redis
    RL->>Redis: 2. INCR requests_{client_id}
    Redis-->>RL: 3. Request count: 95
    
    RL->>Redis: 4. EXPIRE requests_{client_id} 3600
    Redis-->>RL: 5. OK
    
    %% Rate limit decision
    alt Request allowed (< 100/hour)
        RL->>Gateway: 6. Allow request
        Gateway->>LP1: 7. Forward request
        LP1-->>Gateway: 8. Service response
        Gateway-->>Client: 9. Success response
    else Rate limit exceeded
        RL->>Redis: 10. GET rate_limit_{client_id}
        Redis-->>RL: 11. Limit: 100
        RL-->>Client: 12. 429 Too Many Requests
    end
    
    %% Update metrics
    Note over RL, Redis: 13. Update rate limit metrics
    RL->>Redis: 13. INCR metrics_requests_total
```

## Circuit Breaker Pattern

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Closed
    
    Closed --> Open : Error threshold exceeded
    Closed --> HalfOpen : Manual reset
    
    Open --> HalfOpen : Timeout elapsed
    Open --> Open : Reset timeout
    
    HalfOpen --> Closed : Success threshold met
    HalfOpen --> Open : Failure threshold exceeded
    
    note right of Closed
        Normal operation
        Requests pass through
        Monitor error rate
    end note
    
    note right of Open
        Circuit breaker open
        Reject all requests
        Fail fast pattern
        Wait timeout period
    end note
    
    note right of HalfOpen
        Testing recovery
        Allow limited requests
        Monitor success rate
        Auto-recovery test
    end note
```

